WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Heat pumps are the future of residential HVAC. R-410A replacements are all heat
pump compatible.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Quiz covering ductwork design, Manual J basics, brazing and soldering, line set
installation, and system commissioning procedures.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Installation skills are essential for new
construction and equipment replacement jobs.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
